WEBVTT

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.640
Age.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:31.950
Lecty says that the
Tribe of Gold didn't abandon us.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:37.330
They knew all our desires and left
us the door that leads to the future.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.210
Just like they once said...

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:47.970
"Come forth..." Now is the time
for us to respond to their intent.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
Althaia... So it survived.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:08.320
Multiple gravitational disturbances...
Many more following.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.700
Maintain the fleet orbit.
Do not initiate anything!

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.080
We have confirmed a starway
on the enemy ship's course.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:20.960
Initially it wasn't there in our data.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.670
It must be the Argonaut.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.970
They always create a path
no matter where they go.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.260
What would you like to do?

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.010
Reorganize the main fleet in the current zone.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.520
Leave the royals under the care of the
units behind us. We will travel that starway!

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.560
We will gladly follow that ship's guidance!

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:47.690
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:53.910
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:14.300
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:21.400
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.270
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:28.360
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.200
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.780
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.280
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.950
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:46.800
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:51.800
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:02:51.890 --> 00:03:00.640
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:04.810
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.750
Core system successfully engaged.
Communications with the main block,

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:26.790
the engine and power
chamber have been resumed.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.840
Retuning to normal system control.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.800
As soon as the A.I. is entirely up,
have them adjust the recovery plan.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.550
Our friend's recovery is so fast,
it could cause confusion.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:39.060
Huh? Multiple parts of the
system have sustained damage!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.810
We're unable to counter
all the planetary gravity!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.980
We avoided a crash.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.190
What?

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.780
Great job, Bee.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.320
I have confirmed inconsistencies
between your information and mine.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.490
I'll correct my data.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:03.830
A peculiar field has appeared
in the area under renovation!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.080
We have a new friend working for us.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:21.180
To think he can provide such high-level
reconstruction with no materials...

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:26.020
All my fellow beings are
ordering me to help you clods.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.770
How do you even manage
to travel between planets

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.230
on a ship with no regenerating capability?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:36.610
Now that I think about it, you have
chased us from the planet Olone.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.200
In other words, we're like old friends.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:44.750
We'll lean heavily on you and the
technology of your superior tribe.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:48.580
I'll regenerate them as
fast as I destroyed them.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.210
I have confirmed renovations in multiple areas.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:54.880
I can't adjust the plan
fast enough to keep up...

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:59.680
It looks like we won't have to wait for a
rescue while worrying about food shortage.

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.180
But still, we can't even hold a
decent funeral for our Mr. Hero.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:12.570
He's been that way for a long time.
He's not connected to anyone.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:15.070
He doesn't even respond to my voice.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.570
Just leave him alone.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.410
He deserves it.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:22.530
Emotions are now rooted
in me because of him!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.750
I can no longer even entrust
them to Prome and erase them!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.500
Do you want to erase them?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.540
There's no way to erase them!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.630
Listen, don't you ever die again!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.300
Understood.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.970
How annoying...

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:41.680
Not knowing when my emotions
will get provoked makes me so worried.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:51.610
But they can give you support at times,
just like they always did for Age and Belcross.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:56.610
I guess I'm the only one who still hasn't
exchanged words with the fifth one.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:11.830
What a fool... Now I can't even
take you back home with me.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.960
I bet he went ahead to the
other universe by himself.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:18.760
That's right. You think so, too, right, Mehitak?

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:21.760
That... I don't know.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.220
What we were able to sense was that

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:29.480
Belcross turned himself into a key
and became one with the door.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:31.270
It's unclear whether the existence

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.770
that was Belcross was separated back
out and resurrected beyond that door.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.030
So will it be all right if that comes back?

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:40.820
If that happens, maybe Age, too...

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:47.990
I believe that he's beyond that
door and waiting for us to come.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.160
Yes, yes!

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.250
You're right! He must be!

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:55.710
You'll find out once you go through the door.
Prome and the others will arrive soon.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:07:02.010
Our tribe decided to lead the majority
of the Bronze Tribe and go beyond the door.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.680
Now that the agreements have been fulfilled,

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:07.890
the people of the tribe are
telling me to ask your intentions.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:13.020
I wish to learn further wisdom
together with Prome-sama.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:16.690
Of course I'm going beyond that door.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.780
I'll go, too. To the place where Age has shown.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.160
I'm going, too.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:28.910
And what about your
so-called "something precious"?

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.870
No problem.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:33.870
How about the Tribe of Iron?

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.580
We are...

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:38.420
The promise that we
made with Age still remains.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:42.050
It's the one thing Age asked of us.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:45.090
There's no way we can set out
on a journey without fulfilling it first.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:47.930
That's what the princess says.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:08:00.900
Keete... Fuuto's favorite food is posto's roots.

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:06.450
Let's restore that planet no
matter what it takes... with our hands.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.250
Are they here, Aneasha?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:17.130
They've already finished renovating
the imperial room, Dhianeila-sama.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:20.460
Let's give those glorious tribes

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:27.800
that are about to set out on a new journey
a warm welcome, and then see them off.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.440
You, Tribe of Iron, have discovered the path

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.020
with the aid of the memories
that we were entrusted with.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:44.440
We shall welcome you as fellow beings
who should journey along with us.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:49.240
Prome O, we're not ready
to travel with you just yet.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:53.660
If this planet is the place where
the Tribe of Gold emerged first,

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.580
the planet Olone is the last place
they set out on a journey from.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:02.800
The wisdom hidden on those two
planets has been entrusted with you.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:09.720
Just as the stars guide us,
we guide the stars as well.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:14.180
That is the very origin of the power
to know the future and create planets.

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:20.520
The answers are right in front of us,
but we can't even catch a glimpse of them yet.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:23.480
You will come to understand
what they are one day.

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:30.160
That is exactly why you're not afraid
of the door to the outer universe closing.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:34.540
The connections between starways
create the opportunity to open that door.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.160
If there were any meaning
to the war among us...

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.290
That would be to fill
this universe with starways.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:44.500
And the Nodos are the
instruments of that power.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:48.340
We have decided to
share the power with you so

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:52.260
that you can open the door
with additional wisdom.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.810
Power?

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.060
The power we inherited from the Tribe of Gold.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:09.030
It will also open up a spiritual path
between you and the Bronze Tribe.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:13.280
I want you to lead the half of them
who will remain in this universe.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.950
Me?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.750
The shield of Hedron and the Bronze Tribe...

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.080
The princess is going to lead all of them.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:24.040
Another burden will
be put on Dhianeila-sama...

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:28.010
Is this something that
I can share with others as well?

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.930
If you wish to, and they are ready.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.220
I accept it, Prome O,

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:43.150
along with the emotions
which you were forced to bear once.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.440
Thank you.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:56.280
All of us Nodos will go through the door.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:11:03.120
If we find the fifth one, we will use
our powers to send him back to you.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:10.340
The Nodos of the Tribe of Silver,
I truly appreciate your thoughtfulness.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:22.560
The Tribe of Gold always blesses the
ones who open the door on their own.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.150
Maybe I'd forgotten that.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:30.900
Let's go, Rom Ror. Now is the time
for us to be the guidance ourselves.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:52.260
I can't believe we can rise
without consuming energy.

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:55.430
I'll never forget the favor you've done us.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:59.510
Can you follow us with a fragile ship like this?

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:04.520
Remember this ship has been
traveling while enduring your attacks.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:09.570
Now it's your turn to follow us.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:11.230
Bon voyage!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:33.670
The Tribe of Silver's ships...
There are so many of them!

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:35.510
You showed up at the right moment.

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:39.350
Say good-bye to those who are about
to travel to an outer universe, Nilval.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:42.850
Who knows, we may go through
that same door ourselves one day.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.900
Outer universe, you said?

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:52.400
We don't know if that is really
the door until we go through it.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:57.030
But you and I both know that it is.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:04.660
The same goes for the future.
We know that is our future, nobody else's.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:09.750
May the guidance of the stars
be with the Tribe of Iron.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:14.760
May each of you become
guidance for the stars.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:24.080
He's not coming back!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:27.370
He'll be back for sure...

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.080
Age...

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:36.000
You go straight down
the path you want to take.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:46.220
Yes, Age.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.470
Dhianeila-sama?

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:52.940
Let's go. Until the door opens again,

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:56.980
let's tell people far and wide

00:14:57.070 --> 00:15:00.990
that this planet will be
the hope for all the tribes,

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.320
and the path that we must inherit.

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:09.250
Far, far away, in a distant time.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:14.040
In the outer space of this
universe there were people

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:16.880
who responded to the Tribe of Gold's call.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:18.800
"Planet Colonis"

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.180
the Tribe of Bronze,

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:26.680
and the Tribe of Heroes,

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:29.020
and they set out on a journey to
another universe on their own power.

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:47.240
And the ones who newly
answered their call  humankind...

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.410
which came forth into space on its own,

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:54.120
they made many journeys
under great guidance,

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.250
encountered many planets,

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.880
became guideposts and
received guideposts in return.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:05.220
Believing that one day we'll
set out on a journey together

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:09.260
with many other tribes...
from this universe to another one.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:16.100
Believing in that day...

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.990
"Four Years Later"

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.370
It's beautiful.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.760
I finally got to fulfill the promise I made.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:49.100
Right, like you didn't almost forget about it.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.430
I told you, a knight's word is his bond!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.690
Yeah, but it took you
two whole cycles to do this.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:58.190
Tail and Mail should be
arriving at the location now.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.650
How are they doing?

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.860
They're both in really good spirits.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:12.200
Now who's arguing,
ignoring what the princess said?

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:16.160
I'll punish you if you can't
behave and get along with others!

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.840
"Cosmo Mission Control Station
- Apeiron Valles"

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:28.180
I guess any force is powerless as a baby

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:31.350
in the face of the Yunos
knight unit at this point, huh?

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:35.640
Not many can truly wield the Hedron shields.

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:40.480
Our sister, Dhianeila, is the
one who is to guide all the tribes!

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.190
As her brothers,

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:47.150
we're obligated to maintain the order of
this universe using everything we've got!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:51.950
Look at them. They sure know how to
take advantage of their sister's authority.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:55.620
It looks like the knight unit's
captain and the others are back.

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:00.500
Earth Archduchess Nilval,

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:05.090
I thank you for allowing us to have
priority use of the path to the Earth.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:11.050
Same here. Without your help,
we would've faced a ridiculous war again.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:16.270
I feel awful about that, especially
considering the fact that Queen Dhianeila

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.890
has given me such an
audacious title as "Earth Archduchess."

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:20.940
Your government in this star system
has been excellent, your grace.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:24.690
I'm just a traffic coordinator
for those who rush to the Earth.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:29.200
It'd be nice if I knew how to wield
even a single shield of Hedron...

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:34.620
Her highness has been saying that eventually
all of us will be able to wield the power,

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:37.790
and a new path will
open up when that happens.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:42.040
As always, she indicates
to us a path without end.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:46.420
By the way, I've heard that Queen Dhianeila
isn't able to come to this place...

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:50.220
Because the restoration work on
that planet is coming to an end soon.

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:51.260
I see.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.930
This is the last of their bi-cyclical plantings.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:59.140
I imagine they're saying good-bye
to that planet right around now.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:03.060
We've picked up the planting
ships as scheduled, Master.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:04.230
Where's her highness?

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:09.780
Location found. She's at the
land surface point N309E048.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:13.070
Call her through the psycholine.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.840
Although I have known you for a long time

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:39.270
Can you let me stay here just a little longer?

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:39.640
Of course. But...

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.770
I never dreamed

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.640
the Council has suggested that maybe we
should leave some kind of monument there...

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:45.940
These feelings would sprout

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:47.650
Monument?

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:48.980
Something that shows Age was on that planet.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:52.610
And I would fall in love with you

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.570
There's no need for that, Captain.
That's for them to decide.

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.280
Casually going home,

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:06.960
Them?

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:08.380
to establish the civilization of this planet,

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.550
l take the long way on purpose

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:13.670
I'm sure the existence of Age will
be passed down in their own words.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:14.590
Understood. We still have to make
some preparations for departure.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:19.060
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:21.310
Please come back whenever you like.

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:26.690
Thank you, Captain.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:30.320
I just said that so she could be alone, idiot.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:30.940
But that violates the security regulations
concerning Dhianeila-sama quite a bit.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:34.820
anything as long as we stay together

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.200
There's no power that
could possibly hurt her now.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:38.820
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:42.830
It's not exaggerating to say she's
the one protecting us right now.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:43.700
The supreme ruler of the universe
is about to say good-bye to the planet

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:44.410
That I love you

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:51.210
which has been her heart's only solace.
So just sit tight and wait for her.

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:57.470
I didn't realize until I met you

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:01.890
That I was this strong

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:06.190
even though you lived all by yourself.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:06.520
You probably had the
power to know the future.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:11.230
l have found something that l want to protect

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.820
Because more than anyone else,
you gave yourself over to the guidance

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:16.360
And you're the one who's shown me what it is

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.240
of all of we tribes and planets led by
the starways, and you believed in it,

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:21.370
Just being with you makes even

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:25.410
I wish I could have talked to you
about what I must know in the future.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.670
my ordinary days shine brightly

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:31.750
I think the reason why you weren't
lonely is because you knew about it.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.460
Your voice and smile,

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:36.920
l must say good-bye to this planet today.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:38.090
Every time I've come here,
it's felt like you were right beside me.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:43.470
l want to protect them forever

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:47.060
Having met you is my...

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:51.060
On nights we can't see each other

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:52.820
because we're far apart

00:21:54.320 --> 00:22:00.870
I look at the stars in the sky

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:05.450
What's wrong?

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:08.830
A massive change has been
detected in the planetary orbit!

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.750
Sir, this orbit is a different shape
than it's been for the past two cycles.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.420
We've confirmed an unknown field in it!

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:15.000
It looks like it's going
to converge on the planet!

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:17.590
Converge? What is it?

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:21.140
Orbital motions on an unknown orbit...

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:23.850
No... That's not a change.

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:29.190
Now that the planet has been resurrected,
its orbit has returned to its original form.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:59.590
Just like Elysium, Olone once had a door...

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:15.980
Dhianeila created a path.

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:57.020
You tell me you think we can overcome

00:23:57.110 --> 00:24:02.950
anything as long as we stay together

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:09.160
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:24:09.240 --> 00:24:12.830
That I love you

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:15.540
On nights we can't see

00:24:15.630 --> 00:24:18.590
each other because we're far apart

00:24:18.670 --> 00:24:24.840
I look at the stars in the sky

00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:27.890
l want to believe passionately

00:24:27.970 --> 00:24:31.020
in the feelings that I have for you

00:24:31.100 --> 00:24:42.530
and continue to protect them
